      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agree. The fact is there are grouper and non-grouper, non-groupers play in non-group environments(privates, public, or group public which don't require joins.), if devs count those people there will be utterly pointless since they are not the person 'USING' the function.\n\nJapanese community have rather healthy group structures. In the current system, the more you into the group events, the 'physic limit' came quicker and force you to stop. I reached mine in just a year, also sub the VRC+ for the reason, then it's full again since streamers came(2024), in the begin it's possible to abandon smaller, while ignore the groups owner's requests to join, and leave the less-active groups(I don't like this since I will not knowing what's going on to the groups, since MOST of the groups only use the default settings to do group announcements, which will be group only, people outside of the group will never see it even the event itself is for the public, I mean, you won't even know if they are still alive since the page have no sign of being active.) but then you will found there's no more change to sort things out unless you starts to abandons more active groups, in the end you will have to micro-managements, to a point you just give up and can't join new group events. Because that's how many Japanese groups exists. Such harsh limit will not just stop people to join, but also stop the chance of new groups to growth.(since people likes the event will think twice to join)\n\nMost people will roll back and start to use the friend system again(plus it's FREE, and LIMITLESS.), but I'm not the person to make the friend list totally chaos, by the point it's really not worth to sub just for the groups slots, the slots should at least up-adjusts once a while or each years unless there are no more new players, because more players meaning more groups will be created.(Or just sell the slots if that make things easy for both sides.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-01-28T05:40:05.950Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The maximum number of groups is only 100, or 200 with VRC+. This makes it impossible to adequately join a wide variety of groups—not only major events, but also grassroots events, close-knit friend groups, world announcement groups, affiliation or identity groups, expressions of intent, or even simple joke groups.\n\nWhen joining a new group, you must leave an old one.\n\nBecause of this limitation, I was forced to leave the NeoWorlds group and the Japan Street neighborhood association group. As a result, I will no longer receive world update notifications, which should also affect store sales and similar metrics.\n\nWith Group Auto Invitations, event groups will likely push out even more world groups and other types of groups.\n\nPlease consider the struggles of users who actively use groups and have already reached the limit, rather than focusing on the average number of groups joined per user.\n\nja:\n\nグループの上限人数はわずか100、VRC+でも200です。\n\nこれは著名なイベントのみならず草の根のイベント、身内の仲良しグループ、ワールドの告知グループ、所属属性、意思表示、単なるジョークなど様々なグループに満足に入ることを不可能にします。\n\nグループに新たにはいるとき、古いグループを抜けなければなりません。\n\nこの制限によって私はNeoWorldsグループやJapan Street町内会グループを抜けなければなりませんでした。これでワールドの更新通知が届かないことになり、Store売り上げなどにも影響してくるはずです。\n\nGroup Audo Invitationsにより、イベントのグループによってより多くのワールドのグループやその他のグループが押し出されてしまうでしょう。\n\nグループに入っている人数の平均値ではなく、アクティブにグループを使用しており上限に到達して居る人の苦悩を考えて下さい。お願いします。",
